      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a42b8449b8b0a383",
      "translationZh": "修复了在没有 2025 年 11 月修复补丁的 PostgreSQL 版本上，Claude apps gateway 的保留清理操作会删除在同一时刻刷新的回归开发人员身份行的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05a760853e447596",
      "translationZh": "修复了在沙盒自动允许模式下，沙盒化的 Monitor 工具命令会跳过权限提示的问题；现在它们会遵循您的权限规则",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "61f7c8e0f1d25e0a",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 Claude apps gateway 向身份提供者出示的证书具有空主题（subject）时，导致 gateway 无法启动的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d0964169757e94c",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 store.postgres_url 无法解析时，Claude apps gateway 仅以“Invalid URL”退出而没有详细信息的问题；现在的错误会指明具体的设置项并说明该 URL 可能包含的内容",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a2c03e707f9d2d61",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 Mac 从睡眠中唤醒时，后台代理出现“Agent stalled”错误以及 Workflow 工具子代理从其提示词处重启的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0259c7351027be5c",
      "translationZh": "修复了自 2.1.285 版本以来，在 VS Code 扩展等 SDK 宿主环境下，由于托管设置拒绝读取慢速文件系统（特别是 WSL 下的 Windows 驱动器）上的许多路径，从而导致启动缓慢或失败的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7a69b1d693fe37b",
      "translationZh": "修复了在终端中使用 --continue 或 --resume <session-id> 恢复会话时，固定的计划模式（Fixed plan mode）无法恢复的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0970f3af0ff9c86f",
      "translationZh": "修复了一个因命名与另一个 GitHub marketplace 的下载文件夹相同，导致该 marketplace 无法下载的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "897056d6dfe3e1cf",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 Mac 进入睡眠状态时，自动压缩（automatic compaction）因“Prompt is too long”而中断的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9056433c93b8a663",
      "translationZh": "修复了当对话中包含非常大的粘贴堆栈跟踪（stack trace）或源文件时，回溯菜单（Esc Esc / /rewind）在每次按键时会冻结数百毫秒的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a1e4623309bf256",
      "translationZh": "修复了当使用 @-mention 提及其下的文件时，该子目录的 AGENTS.md 未被附带的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9146f86e0d802944",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 sessions 文件夹是相对符号链接时，停止运行后的自托管运行器（self-hosted runner）在恢复会话时出现“missing but already registered worktree”错误的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0742ceb5161a837",
      "translationZh": "修复了当密钥扫描（secret scan）或权限提示遇到长得像 token 的文本时发生的冻结问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd8efc01740a6f51",
      "translationZh": "修复了在只读命令的某些选项值中，Bash 权限检查无法将“读取拒绝”规则或“外部目录读取限制”应用于通配符的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38ec6cf5e80cdf65",
      "translationZh": "修复了 CLAUDE_CODE_USER_DIALOG_TIMEOUT_MS=5m 被误读为 5 毫秒并导致远程对话立即取消的问题；带有单位后缀的值现在会回退到 dialogExpiry",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a72d48c173e4cff5",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 MCP 服务器的工具列表包含非常长的组合字符序列时导致的停顿问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a3bb28277116438",
      "translationZh": "修复了在一个提示词中重叠的两次粘贴操作会被部分作为键入文本而非作为一个完整的粘贴块发送给模型的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ac894749800a8b8",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Chrome 中的 Claude 浏览器选择器在所选浏览器不再连接时显示本应属于 Claude 的消息的问题，以及 VS Code 对话列表在切换后变旧的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a69788a55b413e4",
      "translationZh": "修复了当主会话进入或退出不同的工作树后，后台子代理在其工作树中丢失写入和 Bash 访问权限的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "806bf508a5710534",
      "translationZh": "修复了在机器上没有受管设置强制网关登录的情况下，后台命令、代理视图和守护进程工作器会通过 Claude 应用网关向 Anthropic 发送遥测数据和功能标志请求的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7d30b706585af07",
      "translationZh": "修复了 --restricted（以及 CLAUDE_CODE_RESTRICTED=1）会话会打开跨会话消息套接字的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0043a7b26dfd148e",
      "translationZh": "修复了在空闲时移至后台的会话在重启或空闲清理后重新打开时显示“无保存的转录”的问题；现在它们可以恢复对话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f759e084e0ef4ee",
      "translationZh": "修复了在未接受 bypass-permissions 免责声明的情况下，固定后台工作进程在重新启动时仍遵循 --allow-dangerously-skip-permissions 参数的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbd754de9a46ccd6",
      "translationZh": "修复了当插件的异步 Stop 钩子传递了一个未加引号且包含空格文件夹（如 Application Support）下的脚本路径时，Claude 会陷入无休止循环回复的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29243cfb7580e7bb",
      "translationZh": "修复了当密钥掩码遇到极长的连续文本时会导致冻结数秒的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f064f433bdfc41c8",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 PreToolUse 钩子重写输入后，部分权限规则和安全检查未应用于工具调用的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48906cccd917bc4c",
      "translationZh": "修复了在执行过 claude auth login 或配置目录中已存在凭据文件后，首次启动仍要求重新选择登录方法的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6fa633180f717344",
      "translationZh": "修复了文件名包含换行符时，在文件工具错误和权限提示中显示不正确的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "005a5028dbe084b0",
      "translationZh": "修复了当原位展开的大段粘贴文本包含像 macOS 文件名那样以独立字符存储的重音符号时，在下次按键后会被作为键入文本发送给模型的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d796476f0eaa7792",
      "translationZh": "修复了 macOS /login 在钥匙串拒绝新登录并保留无法删除的旧登录时，仍报告登录成功的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
